cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
title: "OmicsVisStat: Statistical and Visualization Platform for Omics Data Analysis"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-04-27

authors:
  - family-names: "Daramola"
    given-names: "Oluwatosin E."
  - family-names: "Mechref"
    given-names: "Yehia"

repository-code: "https://github.com/odaramola92/OmicsVisStat"
license: "MIT"

keywords:
  - metabolomics
  - lipidomics
  - glycomics
  - proteomics
  - statistics
  - machine learning
  - data visualization
  - LC-MS

description: >
  OmicsVisStat is a graphical user interface (GUI) platform for statistical analysis,
  machine learning, and visualization of omics datasets, including metabolomics,
  lipidomics, glycomics, and proteomics. It provides workflows for data preprocessing,
  differential analysis, model building, and publication-ready figure generation.